title: "Glance: reading typed decisions from open vision-language models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nakajima
    given-names: Yohei
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.1
date-released: 2026-09-21
url: "https://glance.yohei.me"
abstract: "A calibration and measurement harness for asking frozen open vision-language models typed questions about images (yes/no, pick-one, rating) and reading the answer from the logits of one forward pass. Includes pre-registered comparisons with hosted models on photographs taken after every model's release."
